00:57:09,740 --> 00:57:09,940
Right.

675
00:57:10,340 --> 00:57:11,920
I have a $5 million fine.

676
00:57:12,780 --> 00:57:13,840
It doesn't cost millions.

677
00:57:14,000 --> 00:57:16,100
It doesn't cost millions to run a bug bounty program.

678
00:57:16,280 --> 00:57:17,980
Most, most only pay a couple hundred thousand.

679
00:57:17,980 --> 00:57:26,680
